[abl_ms_gru_kalman] Protocol: CONTROLLED GT+smooth-jitter local prior; current-frame GT centres the local SAT search window.
[abl_ms_gru_kalman] 3-frame recurrent state -> v/a + heading/turn-rate -> heading-aware second-order inertial polynomial -> weighted-centroid visual observation -> GRU -> robust constrained route-coordinate Kalman -> one final MeanShift -> final XY.
[abl_ms_gru_kalman] Evaluation intentionally does not solve global acquisition/re-localization: every frame receives a bounded GT-centered local prior.
[abl_ms_gru_kalman] Estimated position may be corrected backward after an over-prediction; physical forward intent is represented by non-negative route velocity.
